Changes: expand includes into static SDF 1.9 models; preserve no-roof model
placements and collision geometry; bake COLLADA scene matrices and centimetre
units into metre/Z-up OBJ geometry; remove textures, UVs and Classic-only ODE
material/friction fields; use flat SDF materials and Harmonic gz-sim system
plugins. Add indexed unit vertex normals for DART mesh compatibility without
changing vertex coordinates, triangle connectivity or winding. The no-roof source already omits the roof and desks. No external Fuel,
Isaac, NVIDIA, ROS package, remote mesh URI or texture dependency is included.

sources.json records the 38 selected upstream inputs with Git blob SHA-1,
SHA-256 and byte counts. The derived occupancy map is generated exclusively
from this adaptation's collision geometry. It is not a real-site map.

This is offline asset preparation. Gazebo compatibility, sensors, Go2 walking
and navigation have not been executed or certified.
